{"id":"636cbfa2301b039f","group":"89","path":"89/89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase.md","title":"A Fixed Point Must Have Larger Modal Degree","display":"ex-fixed-point-degree-increase — A Fixed Point Must Have Larger Modal Degree","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase","aliases":["89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"ex-fixed-point-degree-increase — A Fixed Point Must Have Larger Modal Degree","depends_on":["[[89-ex-fixed-point-computation]]","[[89-df-fixed-point]]","[[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]","[[89-df-modal-degree]]","[[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-fixed-point-degree-increase — A Fixed Point Must Have Larger Modal Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cd2a39dee160249\" href=\"?note=1cd2a39dee160249\" title=\"89-ex-fixed-point-computation\">89-ex-fixed-point-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03089c3cefed4872\" href=\"?note=03089c3cefed4872\" title=\"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness\">89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04ea1c6ff126f884\" href=\"?note=04ea1c6ff126f884\" title=\"89-df-modal-degree\">89-df-modal-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7a04766d8c28cddc\" href=\"?note=7a04766d8c28cddc\" title=\"89-thm-letterless-rank-trace\">89-thm-letterless-rank-trace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\Box p\\to\\Box\\neg p\">\\(A=\\Box p\\to\\Box\\neg p\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_6=\\Box\\Box\\bot\\to\\Box\\bot\">\\(H_6=\\Box\\Box\\bot\\to\\Box\\bot\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 为带字母限制的不动点谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}\">\\(\\mathrm{md}\\)</span> 为模态度数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>，两个显示公式使用同一个指定命题字母。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}degree\\text{-}increase}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{md}(A)=1\\land\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H_6)\n\\land\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H)\\to\\mathrm{md}(H)\\ge2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}degree\\text{-}increase}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{md}(A)=1\\land\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H_6)\n\\land\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H)\\to\\mathrm{md}(H)\\ge2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 105–106；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>已有计算给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_6\">\\(H_6\\)</span> 及其迹 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\setminus\\{1\\}\">\\(\\omega\\setminus\\{1\\}\\)</span>。BookFix 的字母限制使任一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 无字母；唯一性使其 GL 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_6\">\\(H_6\\)</span>。无字母且度数至多 1 的每个盒内式只是底的布尔组合，所以每个盒在 GL 中等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\bot\">\\(\\Box\\bot\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\top\">\\(\\Box\\top\\)</span>。这样的公式在秩 1 和秩 2 世界真值相同：前者盒矛盾均假，盒真式均真。但 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_6\">\\(H_6\\)</span> 在秩 1 假、秩 2 真，由迹等价判据矛盾。\n因此这里不能把结论扩张为任意带新字母候选的语法度数断言；所用无字母性明确来自 BookFix。实际正确的普遍构造界仍为不同盒子公式数，此例为 2。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-ex-fixed-point-computation","status":"resolved","id":"1cd2a39dee160249","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-ex-fixed-point-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"85e306b51d3267ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness","status":"resolved","id":"03089c3cefed4872","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-degree","status":"resolved","id":"04ea1c6ff126f884","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-letterless-rank-trace","status":"resolved","id":"7a04766d8c28cddc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A=\\Box p\\to\\Box\\neg p","display":false},{"tex":"H_6=\\Box\\Box\\bot\\to\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{md}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}degree\\text{-}increase}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{md}(A)=1\\land\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H_6)\n\\land\\forall H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;\n(\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H)\\to\\mathrm{md}(H)\\ge2).","display":true},{"tex":"H_6","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\setminus\\{1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"H_6","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box\\top","display":false},{"tex":"H_6","display":false}],"bytes":1831,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"例子与边界：[[89-ex-fixed-point-computation]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-degree-increase]]、[[89-prop-nonmodalized-fixed-points]]、[[89-ex-fixed-point-table-erratum]]、[[89-ex-godel-sentence-modal]]、[[89-ex-henkin-sentence-modal]]。练习展开：[[89-lem-fixed-point-valuation]]、[[89-thm-double-fixed-point]]。"}],"outgoing":["1cd2a39dee160249","85e306b51d3267ec","03089c3cefed4872","04ea1c6ff126f884","7a04766d8c28cddc"]}